  - kind: 1
    emotion: gurgle
    text: Your room stinks of coal smoke, dry-lander. Your dredging barges and herring
      nets are choking our channels in the bay.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: -1
    nextA: -1
    nextB: -1
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 2
    emotion: anger
    text: Put our warning in tonight's paper. Every boat and net off the water by
      sundown, or I come back with a harpoon.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: I'll print the warning.
    optionB: Get your wet boots off my floor!
    next: -1
    nextA: 3
    nextB: 5
